# Always use Bun

- Package manager: **Bun only**. Never use pnpm, npm, or yarn for installs or scripts.
- Install: `bun install` (CI: `bun install --frozen-lockfile`).
- Scripts: `bun run <script>` or `bun <script>` from the root / package.
- Filter a workspace: `bun --filter @cragfoge/<pkg> <script>`.
- One-off CLIs: `bunx <pkg>` (not `npx` / `pnpm dlx`).
- Lockfile: commit `bun.lock`. Do not add or keep `pnpm-lock.yaml` / `package-lock.json` / `yarn.lock`.
- Root `packageManager` must stay on Bun. Do not reintroduce `pnpm-workspace.yaml`.
